WEBVTT

00:01.880 --> 00:06.220
Satoshi and company have come to Sanpei's home, the Ninja Village.

00:02.980 --> 00:12.830
While watching anime, make sure not to sit too close to the screen and that the room is well lit.

00:09.130 --> 00:15.340
But then a mysterious ninja corps appeared and kidnapped Hanzo, the chieftain of the village.

00:16.170 --> 00:16.730
Not only that...

00:19.230 --> 00:20.060
Rocket Gang!

00:21.710 --> 00:22.460
Gulp.

00:22.460 --> 00:26.350
Oh no! We caught the brat girl and some other girl instead!

00:26.350 --> 00:28.700
Geez! What are you doing, Nyarth?

00:31.740 --> 00:32.470
More gulp!

00:34.800 --> 00:35.800
What's going on?

00:36.010 --> 00:37.430
That was the ninja art of body replacement, was it not?

00:37.900 --> 00:38.990
It's my specialty.

00:45.000 --> 00:47.580
This suddenly feels bad!

00:52.400 --> 00:53.900
You shall let us pass!

00:54.400 --> 00:55.820
Pikachu, Electro Ball!

00:55.820 --> 00:57.690
Gekogashira, Water Pulse!

00:58.990 --> 01:00.370
Gekkouga, Water Shuriken!

01:07.440 --> 01:09.280
Dodge and use Shadow Claw!

01:20.160 --> 01:22.330
Are you all right, Pikachu, Gekogashira?

01:22.330 --> 01:23.640
Hang in there!

01:34.340 --> 01:40.030
Decisive Battle in the Ninja Village!
Gekogashira VS Kirikizan!!

01:40.500 --> 01:42.120
Are you done already?

01:42.310 --> 01:44.230
Kirikizan, Shadow Claw!

01:45.220 --> 01:47.460
Gekogashira, stop it with your Keromousse!

01:52.260 --> 01:52.950
All right!

01:52.950 --> 01:53.800
Do the Night Slash!

01:55.790 --> 01:56.860
X-Scissor!

02:03.010 --> 02:03.570
Gekkouga!

02:04.050 --> 02:06.130
Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

02:07.840 --> 02:08.850
Snarl!

02:26.070 --> 02:26.750
That means...

02:29.570 --> 02:30.560
Sir Saizo!

02:31.030 --> 02:31.670
I'm sorry I'm late.

02:33.780 --> 02:35.010
Razor Shell!

02:42.590 --> 02:43.470
Ippei!

02:44.500 --> 02:45.770
It's dangerous! Don't come closer!

02:46.230 --> 02:46.870
It's terrible!

02:47.220 --> 02:49.650
Hanzo-san got captured by some strange ninja!

02:50.790 --> 02:51.550
The chieftain?

02:53.440 --> 02:54.870
Now we're at a disadvantage...

02:55.440 --> 02:57.270
But we've bought enough time.

02:58.000 --> 02:59.140
Return, Kirikizan!

03:04.500 --> 03:04.830
Wait!

03:04.990 --> 03:14.880
Play a board game via the Pocket Monsters XY& data broadcast!
Press the d-button on your remote and try reaching the battles and the presents!!

03:04.990 --> 03:14.880
Z

03:06.070 --> 03:07.000
There's no need to chase them too far.

03:08.310 --> 03:10.070
The chieftain is in the enemy's grasp.

03:10.750 --> 03:12.900
If we panic now it'll only play to their advantage.

03:14.390 --> 03:15.550
Let's make a plan.

03:16.390 --> 03:17.300
They are escaping.

03:17.670 --> 03:18.300
But why?

03:19.360 --> 03:23.010
It's safe to assume that our opponents have finished their operation.

03:27.490 --> 03:30.470
The chieftain was kidnapped by Kagetomo and his companions.

03:30.720 --> 03:31.630
It can't be!

03:31.830 --> 03:32.370
No way!

03:33.430 --> 03:34.100
"Kagetomo"?

03:35.790 --> 03:36.230
Correct.

03:36.930 --> 03:39.550
He used to lived in this village as one of us.

03:40.030 --> 03:40.910
I remember him.

03:41.730 --> 03:43.280
He was a really excellent ninja.

03:46.800 --> 03:47.450
It's no use.

03:48.070 --> 03:49.780
You can't use the ninja art of rope escape.

03:51.800 --> 03:53.230
Looks like it.

03:54.190 --> 03:56.480
Why don't you show your face already...

03:56.840 --> 03:57.920
Kagetomo?

03:59.150 --> 04:00.180
I've got to hand it to you.

04:01.030 --> 04:02.550
So you've seen through the mask.

04:06.460 --> 04:07.780
It was easy.

04:08.320 --> 04:14.810
Only someone from the Ninja Village knows this technique for tying a rope so you cannot escape it.

04:15.320 --> 04:16.370
Kagetomo-san...

04:16.880 --> 04:18.480
This will be a harsh fight.

04:19.170 --> 04:20.900
Is he that strong?

04:21.190 --> 04:23.490
He was pegged as the next chieftain.

04:24.240 --> 04:28.270
He was supposed to succeed Sir Hanzo and become the leader of this village.

04:29.040 --> 04:29.410
However...

04:32.390 --> 04:36.790
To keep training together with Pokémon, to pursue the potential of Pokémon...

04:37.110 --> 04:39.710
...and to utilize it for the sake of the world, for the sake of others.

04:39.990 --> 04:42.130
That's the mission of us ninja.

04:42.670 --> 04:43.190
You're stupid!

04:45.110 --> 04:46.560
We have power.

04:47.150 --> 04:49.550
Enough power to rule over the world, even!

04:50.450 --> 04:51.020
Am I wrong?

04:51.510 --> 04:54.430
You're being conceited.

04:55.430 --> 04:56.000
No!

04:56.800 --> 04:58.160
In that case, I'll prove it to you...

04:58.950 --> 05:01.070
...as the chieftain of the Ninja Village!

05:01.540 --> 05:05.110
If you act contrary to ninja teachings, I can't give it to you.

05:05.890 --> 05:07.410
The mark of the chieftain, I mean...

05:07.760 --> 05:09.540
The Symbol of the Ninja.

05:12.030 --> 05:16.050
Kagetomo, together with his companion Heidayu, left the village.

05:17.430 --> 05:22.030
Afterwards, they gathered and trained some underlings and formed a ninja corps.

05:22.720 --> 05:23.310
And then...

05:23.680 --> 05:24.800
...he kidnapped the chieftain.

05:25.490 --> 05:25.810
Yeah.

05:26.690 --> 05:31.860
I came to know of their activities and rushed here to tell the chieftain about it,

05:32.560 --> 05:33.560
but I didn't make it in time.

05:34.340 --> 05:36.230
I wonder if Hanzo-san is all right.

05:36.950 --> 05:39.200
Maybe they're doing something terrible to him...

05:40.850 --> 05:41.860
We can sit here and idle no longer!

05:42.340 --> 05:43.940
We must go and rescue him immediately!

05:44.610 --> 05:45.060
Yeah!

05:45.230 --> 05:46.770
Please calm down.

05:46.770 --> 05:49.160
Where are you planning to go if you do not even know where he is?

05:50.990 --> 05:52.560
This is our chieftain we're talking about.

05:53.040 --> 05:54.870
I'm sure he's fine.

05:55.250 --> 05:57.520
Someone from the village is following them.

05:58.370 --> 05:59.710
Let's wait for his report.

06:01.890 --> 06:02.240
Okay.

06:06.470 --> 06:07.490
Kagetomo,

06:08.050 --> 06:10.180
what is it that you're after?

06:10.770 --> 06:12.430
The Symbol of the Ninja?

06:13.350 --> 06:15.510
It's in my inside pocket.

06:15.860 --> 06:16.420
Take it.

06:16.960 --> 06:18.530
I don't intend to steal it.

06:18.800 --> 06:19.150
What?

06:22.340 --> 06:24.260
You will hand it to me at the festival tomorrow.

06:25.440 --> 06:27.830
Then you will declare to the people of the village...

06:28.520 --> 06:31.030
...that you will pass on the title of chieftain to me, Kagetomo.

06:31.590 --> 06:33.830
If you do that, we will release you immediately.

06:36.960 --> 06:39.430
Even if I told them that,

06:39.810 --> 06:42.840
the fellows in the village would never accept you.

06:43.150 --> 06:44.690
I will <i>make</i> them accept me...

06:47.280 --> 06:48.590
...using my power.

06:55.550 --> 06:57.520
Someone from the village seems to have got wind of us.

06:58.000 --> 06:59.830
I assume they will be closing in on us before long.

07:00.210 --> 07:01.700
It's just as I expected.

07:02.350 --> 07:03.680
I don't need anyone but Ippei.

07:04.070 --> 07:04.860
Intercept them.

07:05.030 --> 07:05.220
Sir.

07:08.820 --> 07:10.280
I'm certain it was the chieftain.

07:10.830 --> 07:11.530
Where is he?

07:12.070 --> 07:12.980
Mount Otori.

07:13.310 --> 07:14.980
He's near the summit of Mount Otori.

07:14.980 --> 07:15.550
All right.

07:15.860 --> 07:16.870
Let's go rescue him!

07:24.450 --> 07:25.160
Wait!

07:30.160 --> 07:31.090
Heidayu!

07:31.790 --> 07:32.400
That's him?

07:34.560 --> 07:36.930
I won't let you go any farther!

07:41.980 --> 07:43.300
Brother, Sir Saizo!

07:43.950 --> 07:46.310
Leave this to us; you go to the chieftain!

07:46.500 --> 07:47.220
We'll count on you.

07:48.580 --> 07:49.390
I won't let you!

07:49.650 --> 07:51.550
Kirikizan, X-Scissor!

07:56.290 --> 07:57.540
<i>We're</i> your opponents!

07:58.000 --> 08:00.270
Rentorar, we will fight as well!

08:00.530 --> 08:01.860
Your turn, Tairenar!

08:05.790 --> 08:07.030
Go, Fushigibana!

08:07.030 --> 08:08.400
Come out, Lepardas!

08:20.070 --> 08:20.910
Razor Leaf!

08:20.910 --> 08:22.130
Hyper Beam!

08:23.490 --> 08:25.150
Rentorar, Swift!

08:25.150 --> 08:26.820
Tairenar, Flamethrower!

08:34.980 --> 08:36.990
I will get back at you for what you did earlier!

08:37.350 --> 08:38.790
Gekkouga, Night Slash!

08:40.190 --> 08:42.050
Pikachu, Iron Tail!

08:42.340 --> 08:43.780
Gekogashira, Cut!

08:45.360 --> 08:46.560
Fury Cutter!

09:00.510 --> 09:01.190
Gekkouga!

09:01.630 --> 09:03.060
Pikachu! Gekogashira!

09:08.080 --> 09:08.610
Chieftain!

09:09.630 --> 09:10.570
You're late,

09:11.250 --> 09:11.890
Ippei.

09:14.950 --> 09:15.820
Are you all right?

09:16.210 --> 09:18.290
Yeah, there's no need to worry.

09:18.550 --> 09:19.730
I was getting tired of waiting.

09:20.320 --> 09:21.700
All right, let's battle!

09:28.110 --> 09:30.170
Let's have a battle over the title of chieftain...

09:30.910 --> 09:33.110
...and see who of us is more worthy of it.

09:34.020 --> 09:35.650
Go, Manyula!

09:37.470 --> 09:39.190
Gekkouga, intercept it!

09:45.010 --> 09:46.290
Tairenar, it's coming!

09:46.470 --> 09:47.950
Rentorar, please dodge!

09:48.130 --> 09:48.650
Dodge!

09:55.870 --> 09:56.940
You wanna continue?

09:57.430 --> 10:00.530
I respect your fighting spirit, but it's over!

10:00.720 --> 10:03.710
Pikachu, Gekogashira, run! Distract it!

10:05.570 --> 10:07.990
Gekkouga, approach it and attack!

10:10.230 --> 10:12.180
Kirikizan, Snarl!

10:20.800 --> 10:21.780
Don't let up!

10:22.230 --> 10:23.830
Use Shadow Claw on Pikachu!

10:26.350 --> 10:27.560
Pikachu, get up!

10:40.210 --> 10:41.070
Gekogashira?

10:43.810 --> 10:44.990
Pokémon Quiz!

10:45.550 --> 10:46.400
The answer is...?

11:01.300 --> 11:01.800
What?!

11:07.220 --> 11:08.420
That's the light of evolution...

11:25.830 --> 11:29.790
Gekkouga, the Ninja Pokémon. The final evolved form of Keromatsu.

11:30.420 --> 11:32.340
It appears and vanishes with a ninja's grace.

11:32.900 --> 11:36.990
It toys with its enemies using swift movements, while slicing them with throwing stars of sharpest water.

11:39.730 --> 11:41.980
Tairenar, now it's our turn!

11:42.350 --> 11:44.260
Rentorar, let us fight too!

11:47.230 --> 11:48.900
We can't fall behind either!

11:49.190 --> 11:49.490
No!

11:58.290 --> 11:59.250
Water Shuriken!

11:59.540 --> 12:00.360
Icy Wind!

12:03.550 --> 12:05.190
Pikachu, Electro Ball!

12:09.010 --> 12:11.250
Repel it with X-Scissor!

12:15.840 --> 12:17.350
Gekkouga, Water Shuriken!

12:35.280 --> 12:36.310
All right!

12:38.640 --> 12:39.910
We won't lose!

12:40.310 --> 12:43.110
Kagetomo-sama will become the chieftain!

12:43.390 --> 12:45.090
X-Scissor!

12:45.970 --> 12:48.320
We'll become much, much stronger!

12:48.990 --> 12:49.720
Let's go!

12:57.410 --> 12:58.500
Cut!

13:15.590 --> 13:17.390
What was that just now?

13:27.250 --> 13:28.120
Metal Claw!

13:29.950 --> 13:31.190
Run, Gekkouga!

13:34.270 --> 13:36.470
Kagetomo's Manyula is tough.

13:37.090 --> 13:41.150
In terms of speed and the power of their moves, it is evenly matched with Ippei's Gekkouga.

13:41.150 --> 13:43.670
No, it may even surpass it.

13:43.670 --> 13:44.300
But...

13:44.800 --> 13:45.520
Corner it!

13:46.130 --> 13:47.010
Knock it down!

13:49.010 --> 13:50.470
Gekkouga, dodge!

13:55.230 --> 13:56.600
Well done, Gekkouga.

13:56.980 --> 14:00.130
Ippei has something that Kagetomo doesn't.

14:00.470 --> 14:01.250
And that is...

14:02.210 --> 14:02.990
Brother Ippei!

14:04.390 --> 14:05.040
Saizo-san!

14:06.210 --> 14:06.830
How be the fight going?

14:07.120 --> 14:08.160
There is no need to worry.

14:09.310 --> 14:10.910
Believe in Ippei and Gekkouga!

14:14.910 --> 14:16.950
All right, it's time to finish this.

14:17.910 --> 14:19.840
I will reign over the Ninja Village!

14:20.670 --> 14:22.920
Manyula, Giga Impact!

14:26.080 --> 14:27.300
Double Team!

14:39.630 --> 14:40.480
Now!

14:40.720 --> 14:42.230
Huh? Below!

14:49.840 --> 14:53.110
We'll protect the code and the honor of ninja!

14:53.470 --> 14:55.290
Gekkouga, Water Shuriken!

15:07.300 --> 15:08.290
Stand, Manyula!

15:08.790 --> 15:09.800
What are you doing?!

15:10.500 --> 15:11.390
Fight, will you?!

15:15.410 --> 15:16.180
That's enough.

15:16.690 --> 15:17.810
The match is settled.

15:18.500 --> 15:19.140
Why you...!

15:32.500 --> 15:33.490
I have lost,

15:34.290 --> 15:34.740
haven't I...?

15:37.250 --> 15:40.450
What Ippei has that you don't...

15:41.540 --> 15:42.100
That is...

15:42.370 --> 15:43.470
...self-sacrifice.

15:46.020 --> 15:48.020
He fought for the sake of the villagers' dreams...

15:48.520 --> 15:52.020
...and the future of the village's Pokémon.

15:53.520 --> 15:55.170
For the sake of the world, for the sake of others,

15:56.180 --> 15:58.790
and for the sake of Pokémon...

15:59.910 --> 16:01.490
That's what being a ninja is about.

16:02.320 --> 16:04.610
That was the decisive factor in your match.

16:10.800 --> 16:13.090
And that's precisely why he didn't give up.

16:13.890 --> 16:18.990
He believed in himself and Gekkouga and fought till the end.

16:21.860 --> 16:24.310
Your Manyula put up an excellent fight.

16:25.590 --> 16:26.710
Please praise it.

16:27.270 --> 16:27.970
Ippei...

16:33.110 --> 16:34.950
Well done, Manyula.

16:36.850 --> 16:38.470
You're an excellent ninja.

16:39.250 --> 16:42.890
Please utilize your capabilities for the sake of the world and for the sake of others.

16:51.620 --> 16:55.310
I see. So your Gekogashira has evolved too, Satoshi-kun.

16:55.620 --> 16:57.870
Brother Ippei, me, and now Satoshi...

16:58.370 --> 17:00.330
Together we have three Gekkouga!

17:00.740 --> 17:06.580
We'll become stronger and make sure to keep up with Sanpei and you, Ippei-san!

17:06.950 --> 17:08.840
Good to hear. We have great expectations.

17:09.150 --> 17:09.510
Thank you.

17:18.500 --> 17:23.810
On this day, as of now, the chieftain of the Ninja Village is Ippei!

17:25.050 --> 17:29.440
I will now hand over the symbol of the chieftain to Ippei!

17:55.780 --> 17:59.010
Kagetomo, you're leaving the village?

17:59.910 --> 18:00.230
Yes.

18:01.310 --> 18:04.230
I want to contemplate and rediscipline myself.

18:04.820 --> 18:08.230
You can also train in the village, though.

18:09.090 --> 18:11.220
I can't get your words out of my head.

18:12.610 --> 18:13.330
In order to know...

18:14.150 --> 18:15.700
...how to use my powers for the sake of the world, for others,

18:16.500 --> 18:18.550
I want to see...

18:19.190 --> 18:20.310
...what society is striving for.

18:21.460 --> 18:23.670
Heidayu, you too?

18:24.900 --> 18:26.350
I will follow Kagetomo-sama...

18:27.150 --> 18:27.960
...to the end of the world if need be.

18:28.580 --> 18:31.010
Please make sure to come back to village someday!

18:31.580 --> 18:32.420
We will wait for you.

18:33.430 --> 18:34.110
Thank you.

18:40.400 --> 18:41.430
As for them...

18:42.450 --> 18:43.310
Please take care of them.

18:44.990 --> 18:45.710
Understood.

18:57.040 --> 18:58.310
Thank you for your hospitality.

18:58.690 --> 19:00.830
The festival was so fun!

19:03.010 --> 19:06.050
Feel free to drop by whenever you're close by.

19:06.660 --> 19:07.790
We'll welcome you.

19:08.110 --> 19:10.180
We will, thank you very much.

19:11.060 --> 19:14.050
You be sure to get your next Gym badge as well.

19:14.470 --> 19:15.590
I be rooting for you.

19:16.130 --> 19:18.260
I will. Sanpei, you do your best too!

19:21.540 --> 19:22.030
I will!

19:24.710 --> 19:28.140
And so, the conflict in the Ninja Village has been settled.

19:29.300 --> 19:33.630
Satoshi and his friends set off towards the next badge.

19:44.580 --> 19:46.670
Another form of Gekkouga?

19:47.190 --> 19:49.410
Yes. It was only for a moment, though.

19:57.830 --> 20:02.560
In that case, this village has once again been protected by a Gekkouga.

20:03.680 --> 20:04.900
The hero, huh...?

20:15.960 --> 20:20.930
Sunday December 13th at 8am!

20:16.470 --> 20:18.720
We've come to hijack Pokénchi!

20:18.720 --> 20:20.560
Pokénchi airs on Sundays at 8 AM!

20:24.360 --> 20:25.950
Hot-blooded Pokémon Challenge!!

20:25.950 --> 20:54.960
Gekogashira is trying to set a new record!!

20:26.840 --> 20:29.190
This program passionately presents Pokémon battles.

20:29.420 --> 20:31.670
Today we'll introduce Gekogashira to you.

20:32.540 --> 20:34.650
Look at this Gekogashira's speed.

20:35.000 --> 20:40.030
It has so much strength in its legs it can scale a 600 meter tower in just one minute.

20:40.730 --> 20:43.560
It makes use of the strength of its legs to use Cut.

20:44.090 --> 20:45.790
It's so fast you can't see it!

20:46.380 --> 20:48.070
Watch out! Never give up!

20:48.250 --> 20:50.280
Remember all the training you've gone through!

20:50.980 --> 20:54.620
Well done! Gekogashira, thanks for this moving moment!

20:55.190 --> 20:59.290
And now, Gekogashira is in the middle of an attempt at breaking its record!

21:00.310 --> 21:03.980
Good, you can do even better! Surpass your former self!

21:10.460 --> 21:12.040
Finish!

21:12.040 --> 21:14.040
It achieved a new record!

21:18.150 --> 21:20.090
All right, everyone! Let's go together!

21:20.250 --> 21:21.370
Towards our next adventure!

21:22.710 --> 21:25.590
In this Tripokalon we'll fight for the right to enter Master Class!

21:26.270 --> 21:29.580
Eievui, who will participate for the first time, seems to be really nervous!

21:30.850 --> 21:32.830
It'll be fine. I'm by your side.

21:33.260 --> 21:35.830
Let's show everyone your lovely dance!

21:37.020 --> 21:39.670
Next time on Pocket Monsters XY&Z:

21:40.110 --> 21:42.780
Dance, Eievui! Its Tripokalon Debut!!

21:42.480 --> 21:45.930
Next Time

21:42.480 --> 21:45.930
Dance, Eievui!
Its Tripokalon Debut!!

21:43.230 --> 21:45.100
Everyone, get Pokémon!

21:45.970 --> 21:55.940
Next episode:

21:45.970 --> 21:50.940
The Tripokalon begins!!

21:46.790 --> 21:51.390
Pocket Monsters XY&Z was brought to you by these sponsors.

21:51.000 --> 21:55.940
Eievui's first performance!
